_SCIENCE_GAIN_TINY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"This is no curiosity. The learned among the court must remain focused on the matter."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"I shall not hold my breath for any great revelations. The court has more important matters at hand."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":60,"subjects":["Occurrence","Player Us","Leader Us","City Us"],"text":"A strange malady has been appearing across [rival]. Fever, chills, rashes, and an abundance of other symptoms have produced much debate among the court doctors. Still, thus far, the disease remains a rarity.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_PENDING_DOOM","name":"Omens Swirl","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Courage"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_COURAGE=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_COURAGE_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Perhaps the world ends."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Discipline"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_DISCIPLINE=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_DISCIPLINE_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Perhaps partaking of a feast before slumber was not my wisest choice."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":20,"subjects":["Tile Claimed Us","Occurrence","Leader Us"],"text":"In your dreams, the sky turns black, fish swallow the land, while a rising wind drowns out distant screams.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","conditions":["Eruption"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_RUMBLES_OF_THE_MOUNTAIN","name":"Peak Paranoia","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Begin project: Wary of the Mountain"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aeAddProjects: PROJECT_WARY_OF_THE_MOUNTAIN"],"id":"BONUS_PROJECT_WARY_OF_THE_MOUNTAIN","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Let us not stray any closer to the mountain than needed."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Courage"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiRatings: RATING_COURAGE=1"],"id":"BONUS_GAIN_COURAGE_1","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"None should fear children's stories."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":60,"subjects":["Tile Claimed Us","Occurrence","City Us","Player Us"],"text":"Local tribes once called the mountain the 'Slumbering Beast', a creature of might and terror. Now all of [city] whispers the ancient tales, as terrifying rumbles can be heard from beneath the once-peaceful slopes.","timing":{"repeat":"Once per game"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","conditions":["Tsunami"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_A_GREAT_WAVE","name":"Riding High","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"+1 Legitimacy"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iLegitimacy 1"],"id":"BONUS_SPOKE_OF_NATIONS_GREATNESS","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Reassure the populace, this is naught but an omen that [rival] itself is a rising wave."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-8,"per":-2,"text":"-8 Wood (-2/city)","yield":"wood"},{"