e","City Us","Player Us"],"text":"In [city], the ground shakes. Belongings are scattered, buildings sway, prayers are spoken. No real damage was done, but the people mutter fearfully what is to be done.","timing":{"repeat":"Every 40 turns"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","conditions":["Hurricane"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_SEASON_OF_STORMS","name":"The Next Storm","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-5,"per":0,"text":"-5 Orders","yield":"orders"},{"base":-30,"per":-10,"text":"-30 Wood (-10/city)","yield":"wood"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["AddImprovement IMPROVEMENT_HARBOR"],"id":"BONUS_ADD_HARBOR","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_ORDERS=-5"],"id":"BONUS_ORDERS_LOSS_AVERAGE","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_WOOD=-30","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_WOOD=-10"],"id":"BONUS_WOOD_LOSS_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"[city], and its ships, should have shelters against the wind."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Gain trait: Humble","tip":["+1 Wisdom","+20 opinion with same-trait characters"],"tipTitle":"Humble — trait"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aeAddTraits: TRAIT_HUMBLE"],"id":"BONUS_GIVE_TRAIT_HUMBLE","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"No man may know the sea's will."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":60,"subjects":["Tile Claimed Us","Occurrence","City Us","Player Us","Leader Us"],"text":"Every vessel, from the smallest fishercraft to larger trading ships, seeks shelter against the harsh winds along the coasts near [city]. Such is the pattern each storm season, and yet, the oldest residents tell tales of seaborne wrath that surpasses any yet seen.","timing":{"repeat":"Every 40 turns"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_WHAT_OF_THE_GODS","name":"There is Yet Time","options":[{"leadsTo":[{"cat":"calamities","id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_CRUEL_GODS","name":"Cruel Gods"}],"linkAdd":"EVENTLINK_CALAMITIES_OFFERINGS","outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-30,"per":-10,"text":"-30 Food (-10/city)","yield":"food"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_FOOD=-30","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_FOOD=-10"],"id":"BONUS_FOOD_LOSS_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The gods shall hear our worship. You shall oversee a great feast, and offerings, in the ancient tradition."},{"leadsTo":[{"cat":"calamities","id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_CRUEL_GODS","name":"Cruel Gods"}],"linkAdd":"EVENTLINK_CALAMITIES_OFFERINGS","outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-80,"per":-20,"text":"-80 Money (-20/city)","yield":"money"},{"base":-20,"per":-5,"text":"-20 Wood (-5/city)","yield":"wood"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_MONEY=-80","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_MONEY=-20"],"id":"BONUS_MONEY_LOSS_TINY","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_WOOD=-20","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_WOOD=-5"],"id":"BONUS_WOOD_LOSS_TINY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The gods shall hear our worship. A pyre of offerings, reaching up to the heavens, shall shine as bright as our piety."},{"leadsTo":[{"cat":"calamities","id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_ANGRY_GODS","name":"Woe-speaker"}],"linkAdd":"EVENTLINK_CALAMITIES_NO_OFFERINGS","outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"text":"Opinion memory"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["Memory MEMORYRELIGION_NO_OFFERINGS"],"id":"BONUS_CALAMITIES_MEMORYRELIGION_NO_OFFERINGS","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"Hear the people, [character]. Times are changing, and [rival] enters a new age."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":60,"subjects":["Tile Claimed Us","Religion Player Pagan","Religion Head Us","Occurrence","Player Us","Leader Us"],"text":"[character] implores you, do not let [rival] turn its back on the gods. He talks of a younger generation who do not even know the ancient names, of traditions fallen from practice, of a casual disrespect for the old ways. \"When the gods hear our worship, they are a shield against all misfortune, and a sword against our enemies. Should we falter... I fear in time [city] will stand not as the mighty pillar of a great nation, but a monument of hubris, built of rubble and bones.\"","timing":{"repeat":"Every 60 turns"},"trigger":"Occurrence Ready","weight":1},{"author":"Jeri Roys","conditions":["Wildfire"],"id":"EVENTSTORY_CALAMITIES_TINDERBOX","name":"Tinderbox","options":[{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[{"base":-4,"per":0,"text":"-4 Orders","yield":"orders"},{"base":-20,"per":-5,"text":"-20 Stone (-5/city)","yield":"stone"}]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_ORDERS=-4"],"id":"BONUS_ORDERS_LOSS_SMALL","pct":null,"weight":null},{"fields":["aiGlobalYieldsBase: YIELD_STONE=-20","aiGlobalYieldsPer: YIELD_STONE=-5"],"id":"BONUS_STONE_LOSS_TINY","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"We must fireproof what we can."},{"outcomes":[{"rewards":[]}],"raw":{"bonuses":[{"fields":["iOccurrenceTargetSubject 0","bOccurrenceSetPending 1"],"id":"BONUS_OCCURRENCE_SET_PENDING_S0","pct":null,"weight":null}],"gates":[]},"requirements":[],"text":"The rains shall come, soon enough."}],"pack":"Wrath of Gods","prob":60,"subjects":["Tile Claimed Us","Occurrence","City Us","Player Us"],"text":"Dry season after dry season in [city] has brought woe and worry to the locals. Trees and houses alike